WEBVTT

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:12.360
This is great, Majo Rika.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:19.980
With this tree that grows magic spheres, we'll be set for life!

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:58.470
Victory

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.550
What are you doing, Majo Rika?

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:06.930
Did ya hit yer head or somethin'?

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:10.230
I think she's casting a curse on someone.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.040
Idiots!

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:14.940
I'm praying for your sakes!

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:16.840
Why?

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:26.740
Doremi Aces It? The Level 3 Exam.

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:30.830
The level 3 exam?

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:37.700
Yes, I'm praying very hard so that you all pass the level 3 exam.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:38.970
So stop your babbling.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:41.930
Oh yeah, the next exam should be comin' up real soon.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.140
The exam is TONIGHT!

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:47.100
But why are you praying for us?

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:51.400
Yeah, ya never prayed before.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.060
You say that because you don't know.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:57.180
Do you have any idea how tough the level 3 exam is?

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.580
Majo Rika's right.

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:00.360
Lala.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:06.140
Among all the exams, the level 3 one is the one that the most witch apprentices fail.

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:11.050
Even if an apprentice successfully passes all the previous exams,

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:13.620
the level 3 exam is simply too tough for some of them.

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:19.520
So there have been many apprentices who gave up their Porons at this stage and returned to being normal girls.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.960
So please be careful and try your best, everyone.

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:24.420
Okay!

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:28.740
But we've always passed somehow.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:31.220
I think we'll be fine this time too.

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:34.810
YOU'RE the one that I'm most worried about!

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:41.940
That song...

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:51.020
~ Good day. ~

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:54.040
~ How are you all doing? ~

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.430
Good day.

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:57.670
Oh? Do you bring good news again?

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:02.290
Yes, I have something nice to tell you all today.

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:03.550
So where's Majo Rika?

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:07.920
Why are you hiding? How rude.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:11.310
No, I'm not really hiding.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:16.000
Whenever Dela comes, she does this as a reflex.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.170
I feel sorry for Majo Rika.

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:20.320
Oh my, I don't want to be like that.

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:23.240
So Dela, what's your good news?

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:26.620
Yes, yes, it's something awesome.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:30.580
There's a tree that can grow magic spheres?

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.750
I-Is that true?

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.180
Yes, it is.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.830
In order to celebrate the 100th year of the Queen's reign,

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:43.260
she will be giving a seed that can grow such a tree to all of the apprentices who pass!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:52.820
A seed of a tree that grows magic spheres?

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.640
That's a hard sentence to say.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:58.850
But I can't believe that magic spheres grow on trees.

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:00.980
What kind of flowers will be on the tree?

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:04.490
That's not important!

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.460
The magic spheres are!

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:14.200
With that tree, I won't ever be in debt again!

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.540
...again!

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:18.630
Majo Rika!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.430
You're drooling, you're drooling!

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:22.760
You won't get a tree if your apprentices don't pass.

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:25.340
Did you hear that, you three!?

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.010
Yes, yes.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.240
If we don't pass this exam...

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:30.730
Then we're definitely gonna get it!

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:31.470
Right?

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.060
It's good that you understand.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:53.870
Pretty Witchy Pop-chi!

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:06.590
I have to make it to the exam, so I'm definitely not falling asleep tonight!

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:12.600
Pipitto Puritto Puritan Peperuto!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.840
Come out, coffee!

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:17.980
I did it.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:20.150
I'm so much better than that idiot Doremi.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.810
Time to drink up!

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:27.530
So bitter...

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:32.530
Why do adults drink so much of this stuff?

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:37.760
I think I can add a bit of sugar.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:41.260
Well, I should add some milk too.

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:42.960
Okay!

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:50.720
But that would be wasting magic spheres... right?

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:55.970
It'll be fine even if I get caught, since I'm getting milk.

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:05.600
Pop.

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:12.110
What is it, Mother?

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.620
What are you doing up so late?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.580
I'm a bit thirsty, so I'm getting some milk.

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:20.460
I see.

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.540
Milk.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.960
Yes, milk.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:24.920
I see.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:26.000
Yes.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.370
Nope.

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:30.930
Why?

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:34.140
If you drink milk this late at night, you'll wet your bed!

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:38.000
Hey! I'm not like Doremi!

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.600
No is no! Stop complaining and get back to bed.

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:43.230
Why's it gotta be this way!?

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:46.660
Stop it! Let go of me!

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:50.560
Drinking milk at night is the first step of growing up!

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:54.430
Hey! You're drinking coffee again!

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:55.570
I'll be taking this.

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:01.870
So like usual she ain't comin'.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:04.790
Pop-chan is so scary when she's sleeping.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:08.380
I am never trying to wake her up ever again.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:11.090
Nooooo~!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.860
You have to wake me up...

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:33.210
Ah, it's Onpu-chan!

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:34.410
Hey!

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:40.700
Oh? Are you all taking the exam?

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:42.080
Yes, you too?

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:43.560
Me?

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:45.040
I'm done already.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.270
So that means...

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:48.340
Ya passed?

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.300
Yep. I also skipped ahead and passed the level 2 exam.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:53.460
Skipped?

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:56.010
How are you able to skip exams like that?

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:57.970
I'm not too sure...

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:00.850
Hey, hey, was the exam hard?

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.140
I wouldn't worry about it.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.020
It was so easy that I was surprised.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:07.670
I see!

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:10.080
So there's not a thing to worry about!

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.640
Oh yeah, Onpu-chan, have you gotten that seed yet...

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:15.530
Let me see that seed that can grow a magic sphere tree!

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:16.910
Okay, sure!

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:19.830
This is it.

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.080
Listen up!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:28.080
You have to get this seed that can grow a magic sphere tree!

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.460
Okay!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.930
Well, try your best, okay?

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:37.110
Today's exam is...

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:40.220
This...

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:46.230
Before this clock's hand completes one revolution...

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:50.650
you must pass through three doors in three different worlds and return here...

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:54.190
in order to pass...

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:58.070
So yer sayin' we hafta find those three doors, right?

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.830
Exactly...

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:07.330
But you can only use magic twice...

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.290
Huh? Why?

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:10.620
You idiot!

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:12.390
That's part of the exam!

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:13.590
Do your best, everyone.

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:17.140
Okay, let's work together and pass!

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:17.890
Yes!

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:20.590
Ahh, that won't work either...

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:25.770
You are doing this exam on your own today...

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.120
Now then...

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:37.360
when you go through your door...

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:40.520
The timer will start...

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:02.770
The weather sure is nice, Ume-san.

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:07.660
This is too easy!

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:22.410
She said that we could only use magic twice...

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:24.720
I wonder if I should use magic here...

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:28.570
Oh well, I'll just find some other way there.

00:12:37.390 --> 00:12:39.040
What, what, what, what!?

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.660
Who goes there?

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:46.570
Who stepped on my heeeeeeeaaaaaaaaad?

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:56.160
Doremi!

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:57.580
Aren't you Doremi?

00:12:58.330 --> 00:12:59.550
Majo Ume-san.

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:01.740
Welcome, Doremi.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:05.970
Everyone, this is Doremi, the witch apprentice.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.180
She took care of me in the Human World.

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:12.180
So she's that Doremi.

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:14.100
She's the model witch apprentice, eh?

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.600
The one from your story...

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:22.010
Yes! I'm the model witch apprentice, Doremi-chan!

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:40.790
Welcome to the Witch's Maze.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.550
The Witch's Maze?

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:46.510
As a reward for finding me, I shall tell you the way to the door.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:47.970
Eh? Really?

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.860
Yes, really.

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:52.370
But you have to give me one magic sphere.

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:53.680
What? There's a price?

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.020
Ahhhh, wait!

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:57.640
What?

00:13:58.280 --> 00:14:01.200
Don't be like that, listen to my explanation.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:04.070
The economy has been bad lately.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.490
And I haven't had anyone to talk with.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:12.160
I can't do much if the economy is bad, but I can chat with ya.

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:16.180
Really? Then please listen.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:17.080
Sure.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.080
But don't ask me fer magic spheres in exchange.

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.540
You have a good business sense.

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:23.050
I'll show you the way to the door.

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:24.580
Thanks!

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:33.140
You're so loud!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.390
You woke up my baby!

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:35.840
I can't do business this way!

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:37.030
This is awful!

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:40.350
Come on, let's hurry her out the door.

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:57.370
Thank you for coming.

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:00.830
This manjuu is delicious!

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.400
Oh, really?

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:03.760
Then eat up.

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:06.800
It's been several hundred years since we've had a guest.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:09.610
I'll bring everyone else next time.

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:13.550
Maybe Majo Rika will like this place and decide to live here.

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:16.560
Oh yeah, Doremi.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.020
What brings you here in the first place?

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:21.600
Oh yeah! I'm in the middle of an exam!

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:32.780
The door you're looking for...

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.700
Was it a golden door?

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.160
Or was it a silver door?

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.560
I know all 'bout this riddle.

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:46.180
I ain't lookin' fer either a golden or a silver door.

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:47.090
I'm lookin' fer a normal one.

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.550
W-What...

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.010
Where's the normal door?

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.970
I-Inside the fountain.

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:05.400
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:08.400
Door in the fountain, come out!

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.720
Alright!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.790
That was close.

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:31.130
I almost forgot about the exam.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:34.590
Well, the door is right there, so I should be fine.

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:42.940
Ah! You're...

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:45.690
That's the witch apprentice, who helped bring us together! Doremi-san!

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:48.190
It's Surumeko-san and Hachitaro-san.

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:52.970
Because of your help, I'm finally getting married to Surumeko-chan.

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:56.400
Please be a part of our wedding.

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:57.900
Please.

00:16:57.900 --> 00:16:59.480
The next door is over there.

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:01.080
But there's a delicious cake.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:05.540
Of course, I'll gladly eat... No, I'll gladly take part!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:45.710
W-Water...

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.580
Water? Alright, just wait a second.

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:56.430
But you can only use magic twice...

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:59.890
If I use magic here, then I can't use magic fer the rest of the exam.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:00.760
But...

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:04.230
I can't just leave her here!

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:10.310
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:12.740
Ice-cold water, come out!

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:17.600
Here, ma'am.

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:23.370
Thank you.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:26.670
It's been so long since I drank such delicious water.

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:36.850
You passed...!

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:38.340
Congratulations...!

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:42.760
Where're Doremi-chan and Hadzuki-chan?

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.620
They aren't back yet.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:11.540
My jokes are so cold that they can freeze anyone within five seconds.

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:20.630
The futon... flew off! (Same pronunciation)

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:26.100
So cold.....!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:32.520
This is the first time... someone has laughed!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.360
I'm so grateful!

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:40.200
Congratulations...!

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:43.060
Alright, now we jus' gotta wait on Doremi-chan!

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:43.980
Doremi-chan...

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:48.180
Take care!

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:50.870
Please come again!

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:51.790
Goodbye!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:55.740
That takoyaki cake was the best!

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.720
What? The last door already?

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:07.950
The level 3 exam really was too easy.

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:09.890
Onpu-chan was right.

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:13.850
That smell is...

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.320
Hello!

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:20.120
Steak!

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:22.780
And it only costs one magic sphere!

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:28.130
Ahh, but this is suspicious, too suspicious.

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:30.330
But a steak is only one magic sphere...

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:31.830
But I pass once I go through that door...

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.270
But a steak is only one magic sphere...

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:35.080
But the door is open...

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:36.750
So I choose steak!

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:48.850
Ma'am!

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:54.770
I want to bag all the steak you have!

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:57.060
Thanks for your patronage!

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:10.280
You failed...!

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:13.500
You did not escape the trap...

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:20.110
Here, your spheres of certification...

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:26.550
And here is a seed that can grow a magic sphere tree...

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:32.810
The directions on how to plant the seed are inside the bag too...

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:38.610
Oh? This manjuu is pretty good.

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:42.900
If only there wasn't a steak stand there!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:46.610
It's hopeless, I'll be like this forever!

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:51.580
Even though we passed and got the seed...

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:54.540
It takes 200 years fer it to even grow.

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:57.620
This is too much!

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:04.840
Taniyama-kun is really good at shogi.

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:08.400
It's a shame that he's gotta give it up 'cause of his parents.

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:10.860
He loves playing so much, so how can he quit like this?

00:22:10.860 --> 00:22:11.700
Yeah!

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:16.660
I haven't passed the level 3 exam yet, but I'm not giving up on becoming a witch!

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:19.860
Alright! I'll definitely pass next time!

00:22:19.860 --> 00:22:22.590
Doremi-chan, did you forget about Taniyama-kun?

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:23.500
Eh?

00:22:23.500 --> 00:22:24.660
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:26.710
Father and Son - The Move Towards Victory!

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:29.300
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
